# Per-repo release values, sourced by scripts/release/_lib.sh. preflight,
# postflight and sync-dev are separate entry points, so a value declared in one
# script is missing from the other two; this file is the one place all three
# read.
#
# This repo releases a skill bundle: no Cargo manifest, no package.json, and
# no binary. The version a `vX.Y.Z` tag names lives in VERSION, which the
# preflight mechanics gate and sync-dev-after-release.sh read directly, so
# RELEASE_MANIFEST stays unset.

# The changelog the GitHub Release notes are cut from. Naming it makes the
# preflight mechanics gate fail when the file is missing rather than skip.
RELEASE_CHANGELOG="CHANGELOG.md"

# drift.sh gate 0 compares the previous release's VERSION and CHANGELOG.md
# line by line, the default. Every release ships dev's whole tree minus the
# guarded engineering docs, so "version" mode, for a release that ships less
# than dev, does not apply here.
# DRIFT_MANIFEST_COMPARE="version"
